<strong>What laptop size can the Urban U6 fit?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The Urban U6 fits most laptops up to 16 inches, including MacBook Pro 16\", making it a practical work backpack for professionals and students carrying tech essentials.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_g8dg64":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Does the Urban U6 have anti-theft features?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Yes. A concealed back zipper pocket keeps valuables such as passports, wallets, and phones protected and close to your body while traveling or commuting.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_Epnadi":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the Urban U6 comfortable for all-day carry?<\/strong>","text":"<p>The Urban U6 features breathable honeycomb-padded shoulder straps and a lightweight construction to reduce shoulder strain during long commutes, workdays, or city exploration.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_HE9twj":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the Urban U6 waterproof?<\/strong>","text":"<p>No.The Urban U6 uses DuPont® water-repellent nylon fabric and water-resistant zippers to help protect your belongings from light rain, splashes, and daily weather conditions.Does not offer full waterproof protection<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_3Nyhig":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Choose U5 or U6?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Choose <a href=\"\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u6-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban U6 Backpack\">U6<\/a> for lighter weight and a clean commuter shape. <br\/>Choose <a href=\"\/products\/nayo-smart-urban-u5-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban U5 Backpack-White\">U5<\/a>for a flap design and full-open access.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["question_qRAqhY","question_z3pxtb","question_xLc3ib","q